# Signing keystore is committed on purpose (required for consistent update signatures).
# Any new release keystore must stay out of git (use GitHub Secrets + CI).
*.keystore
*.jks
!android-native/app/debug.keystore
# between local builds and GitHub Actions). The password is intentionally public.

